<title>USA: Respironics apnea treatment gets FDA OK.</title>
<headline>Respironics apnea treatment gets FDA OK.</headline>
<dateline>MURRSVILLE, Pa. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Respironics Inc said Monday it had won 510(k) clearance from the Food and Drug Administration to market its new Quartet Clinical System to diagnose and treat obstructive sleep apnea.</p>
</text>
